# BridgeClip
#
# BridgeClip needs no environment variables to run. It has no account and no
# server: provider keys are entered in the app (Settings, or the setup card on
# first launch) and stored on this machine, encrypted with the OS keychain.
#
# Providers:
#   OpenRouter  - MAI Transcribe 2 transcription and picking the moments to clip
#   NVIDIA      - free cloud planning (Settings → AI provider): clip selection on
#                 build.nvidia.com's free NIM tier with local faster-whisper
#                 transcription. The engine-side variables are listed in
#                 docs/nvidia-cloud.md.
#   Local AI    - offline mode (Settings → Local AI): faster-whisper transcription
#                 and an Ollama planner on this machine, no key needed. The
#                 engine-side variables are listed in docs/local-ai.md.
#
# Optional, when huggingface.co refuses downloads from your network:
# HF_ENDPOINT=https://hf-mirror.com
